ales especiales.", "FORMULACIÓN 2 EN 1:La formulación 2 en 1 es una mezcla de glucosa y aminoácidos administrada con emulsión lipídica de manera independiente, utilizada en nutrición parenteral para evitar interacciones de fármacos.", "FORMULACIÓN 3 EN 1:La formulación 3 en 1 combina aminoácidos, glucosa y lípidos en una sola bolsa, reduciendo el riesgo de contaminación y la manipulación durante la administración.", "AA RAMIFICADOS:Los aminoácidos ramificados son un tipo de aminoácidos que se utilizan en soluciones de nutrición parenteral para pacientes con condiciones críticas, como encefalopatía hepática.", "ENFERMEDAD DE BASE:La enfermedad de base se refiere a la condición médica subyacente que afecta las necesidades nutricionales de un paciente y su tratamiento.", "D-GLUCOSA:D-Glucose is a carbohydrate that serves as a primary energy source, playing a vital role in parenteral nutrition. It influences insulin secretion and contributes to nitrogen savings, making it essential for patients who require nutritional support. Additionally, D-Glucose is responsible for a significant portion of the osmolarity of parenteral nutrition solutions, further underscoring its importance in providing energy to patients.", "GRANDES QUEMADOS:Grandes quemados refers to patients with severe burns who have increased nutritional needs due to metabolic stress.", "PACIENTES POSTQUIRÚRGICOS:", "TCL INTRALIPID:TCL Intralipid is a product derived from soybean oil, used in lipid emulsions for nutritional support, particularly in providing essential fatty acids and influencing inflammatory responses.", "CLINOLEIC:Clinoleic is a 20% lipid emulsion utilized in parenteral nutrition, specifically formulated to deliver essential fatty acids. It is composed of a blend of soybean oil and olive oil, introduced in the late 1990s. Clinoleic is notable for its high content of oleic acid and vitamin E, which contribute to its nutritional benefits. As a third-generation lipid emulsion, it is enriched with olive oil, recognized for its high antioxidant content and its resistance to lipid peroxidation, making it a valuable option in clinical settings for patients requiring parenteral nutrition.", "ALPHA-TOCOPHEROL:Alpha-tocopherol is a form of vitamin E present in Clinoleic, known for its antioxidant properties and health benefits.", "ACIDOS GRASOS W3:Omega-3 fatty acids (AGW3) are incorporated into fourth-generation emulsions like Lipoplus, associated with anti-inflammatory effects.", "ACIDOS GRASOS W6:Omega-6 fatty acids (AGW6) are essential fatty acids that are present in high amounts in traditional lipid emulsions, influencing inflammatory responses.", "HIDRATACION:Hydration is a critical aspect of patient care, involving the management of fluid intake and losses to maintain health."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}